    "Allow read-only access to this Mac’s Cursor sign-in for usage queries? Only the existing Cursor access token is sent to Cursor over HTTPS. No browser cookies, projects or chats are read; no credentials are saved or refreshed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow read-only access to this Mac’s Cursor sign-in for usage queries? Only the existing Cursor access token is sent to Cursor over HTTPS. No browser cookies, projects or chats are read; no credentials are saved or refreshed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许只读访问本机 Cursor 登录状态以查询用量吗？仅通过 HTTPS 将已有 Cursor 访问令牌发送给 Cursor。不读取浏览器 Cookie、项目或对话，不保存或刷新凭证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Another client took this pane over, or the attach closed.": {
