        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将点击和拖动转发给需要鼠标的 TUI 应用。关闭后鼠标始终用于选中文本；按住 Shift 拖动则两种模式都能选中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From the host: gooseagent plugin action invoke gooseagent.tailcat.token — the token is stored in this device's Keychain, and the tunnel needs no SSH.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
