    "On the Mac, run: echo '<key>' >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys — or paste the line into Goose Agent's upcoming pairing screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On the Mac, run: echo '<key>' >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys — or paste the line into Goose Agent's upcoming pairing screen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Mac 上执行：echo '<key>' >> ~/.ssh/authorized_keys — 或将此行粘贴到 Goose Agent 即将提供的配对界面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the remote Mac: `gooseagent plugin install lbr77/gooseagent-plugin-tailcat`, then `gooseagent plugin action invoke gooseagent.tailcat.token` and paste the token here. The WireGuard tunnel is built in — no external tool. The token is stored in the Keychain. Standalone shells and the Files workspace need SSH.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On the remote Mac: `gooseagent plugin install lbr77/gooseagent-plugin-tailcat`, then `gooseagent plugin action invoke gooseagent.tailcat.token` and paste the token here. The WireGuard tunnel is built in — no external tool. The token is stored in the Keychain. Standalone shells and the Files workspace need SSH."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在远程 Mac 上执行 `gooseagent plugin install lbr77/gooseagent-plugin-tailcat`，然后执行 `gooseagent plugin action invoke gooseagent.tailcat.token`，将令牌粘贴到此处。WireGuard 隧道已内置，无需外部工具。令牌存储在钥匙串中。独立 Shell 和文件工作区需要 SSH。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
